    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599138,
    "RowId": 35095,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599150,
    "RowId": 35096,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599162,
    "RowId": 35097,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599174,
    "RowId": 35098,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599186,
    "RowId": 35099,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599198,
    "RowId": 35100,
    "Text": "Forgive me, but I couldn't stay away."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599246,
    "RowId": 35101,
    "Text": "Hm, it seems my sister shall be joining us."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599302,
    "RowId": 35102,
    "Text": "'Tis only fitting that we face you together!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599358,
    "RowId": 35103,
    "Text": "The sands of time are mine to command!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599410,
    "RowId": 35104,
    "Text": "Bear witness to the Keeper's might!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599458,
    "RowId": 35105,
    "Text": "I shall measure your worth."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599498,
    "RowId": 35106,
    "Text": "Time marches to my whim!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599534,
    "RowId": 35107,
    "Text": "Let burn your fleeting lives!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599574,
    "RowId": 35108,
    "Text": "Surrender to my power!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599610,
    "RowId": 35109,
    "Text": "Have you the strength to defy fate?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599658,
    "RowId": 35110,
    "Text": "Show me everything."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599690,
    "RowId": 35111,
    "Text": "Pray to the stars on high!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599730,
    "RowId": 35112,
    "Text": "Like the bejeweled night sky!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599770,
    "RowId": 35113,
    "Text": "Drown in waters divine! "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599806,
    "RowId": 35114,
    "Text": "I will spin your fates."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599842,
    "RowId": 35115,
    "Text": "With me, Sister."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599870,
    "RowId": 35116,
    "Text": "Ever ready, Brother!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599902,
    "RowId": 35117,
    "Text": "O time and fate inexorable, guide them true!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 599958,
    "RowId": 35118,
    "Text": "Long have I awaited this moment..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600006,
    "RowId": 35119,
    "Text": "This, too, is fate..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600038,
    "RowId": 35120,
    "Text": "Clear the fertile plains"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600074,
    "RowId": 35121,
    "Text": "Clear the Roots"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600102,
    "RowId": 35122,
    "Text": "Clear the Bole"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600130,
    "RowId": 35123,
    "Text": "Clear the hanging tributary"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600170,
    "RowId": 35124,
    "Text": "Clear the Barbs"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600198,
    "RowId": 35125,
    "Text": "Clear the Chamber of Revolutions"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600242,
    "RowId": 35126,
    "Text": "That the Matron should welcome us herself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600298,
    "RowId": 35127,
    "Text": "The aetheric analyzer works as it should. Let us press on."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600370,
    "RowId": 35128,
    "Text": "By my authority, let the land be remade."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600422,
    "RowId": 35129,
    "Text": "Of course... It would have to be Althyk who could so manipulate space!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600506,
    "RowId": 35130,
    "Text": "Forgive me, but I couldn't stay away."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600554,
    "RowId": 35131,
    "Text": "Hm, it seems my sister shall be joining us."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600610,
    "RowId": 35132,
    "Text": "Upon the most exalted of battlefields you shall stand."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600678,
    "RowId": 35133,
    "Text": "We are come to a frozen domain. Which means..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600738,
    "RowId": 35134,
    "Text": "Summon your courage and press on!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600782,
    "RowId": 35135,
    "Text": "'Tis all but certain that Halone awaits."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600834,
    "RowId": 35136,
    "Text": "This light... It seems to beckon us to yonder palace."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600898,
    "RowId": 35137,
    "Text": "Prove to me life's resolve!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600938,
    "RowId": 35138,
    "Text": "Mine is the breath of the earth..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 600986,
    "RowId": 35139,
    "Text": "Bow down like the willow."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601022,
    "RowId": 35140,
    "Text": "Know true abundance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601054,
    "RowId": 35141,
    "Text": "My heart rejoices for our union!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601098,
    "RowId": 35142,
    "Text": "Reap the harvest!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601126,
    "RowId": 35143,
    "Text": "Nourish the soil!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601154,
    "RowId": 35144,
    "Text": "Beyond adversity lies strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601198,
    "RowId": 35145,
    "Text": "Feel you the heartbeat of the land?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601246,
    "RowId": 35146,
    "Text": "Let life flower and flourish!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601286,
    "RowId": 35147,
    "Text": "Good children... Be strong for what awaits..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601342,
    "RowId": 35148,
    "Text": "Bare to me your lover's heart!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601386,
    "RowId": 35149,
    "Text": "Behold my power."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601414,
    "RowId": 35150,
    "Text": "Lest you worry, 'tis naught I cannot handle."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601470,
    "RowId": 35151,
    "Text": "Prepare yourselves."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601502,
    "RowId": 35152,
    "Text": "Love moves me to act."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601534,
    "RowId": 35153,
    "Text": "Let's delight in the simple things!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601582,
    "RowId": 35154,
    "Text": "Go on and play!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601610,
    "RowId": 35155,
    "Text": "You're always in my heart, my loves..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601662,
    "RowId": 35156,
    "Text": "I, the Fury, shall test your strength of spirit!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601722,
    "RowId": 35157,
    "Text": "All-piercing spear, drink deep of raging blizzards!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601786,
    "RowId": 35158,
    "Text": "For glory, you must be prepared to render your all!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601850,
    "RowId": 35159,
    "Text": "You must do better than that against me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601902,
    "RowId": 35160,
    "Text": "There is no retreat─only victory or defeat!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 601958,
    "RowId": 35161,
    "Text": "Victory must be seized with one's own hands!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602014,
    "RowId": 35162,
    "Text": "In ice unyielding now rest."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602054,
    "RowId": 35163,
    "Text": "Mine is the aegis!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602086,
    "RowId": 35164,
    "Text": "Ah, would that our clash could continue forever..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602150,
    "RowId": 35165,
    "Text": "Yes, lose yourself in the joy of battle!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602202,
    "RowId": 35166,
    "Text": "Well fought, mortals! Your next test awaits!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602258,
    "RowId": 35167,
    "Text": "3 seconds until time accelerates."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602302,
    "RowId": 35168,
    "Text": "2 seconds until time accelerates."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602346,
    "RowId": 35169,
    "Text": "1 second until time accelerates."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602390,
    "RowId": 35170,
    "Text": "Time accelerates at Althyk's command!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602438,
    "RowId": 35171,
    "Text": "The moon forms at Menphina's command!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602486,
    "RowId": 35172,
    "Text": "The moon begins to wax..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602522,
    "RowId": 35173,
    "Text": "All of our love, we give unto you. Pray accept it, my darlings!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602598,
    "RowId": 35174,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602610,
