  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602826,
    "RowId": 35193,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602838,
    "RowId": 35194,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602850,
    "RowId": 35195,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602862,
    "RowId": 35196,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602874,
    "RowId": 35197,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602886,
    "RowId": 35198,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602898,
    "RowId": 35199,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602910,
    "RowId": 35200,
    "Text": "I've been waiting so long. Don't disappoint!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 602966,
    "RowId": 35201,
    "Text": "そんなんじゃ、びくともしねぇぜ？"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603026,
    "RowId": 35202,
    "Text": "I bring my all to bear!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603062,
    "RowId": 35203,
    "Text": "Drink deep of blackest terror!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603106,
    "RowId": 35204,
    "Text": "No more games!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603134,
    "RowId": 35205,
    "Text": "What!? That's not right!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603170,
    "RowId": 35206,
    "Text": "Battle does so whet the appetite. Gheh heh heh heh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603234,
    "RowId": 35207,
    "Text": "Good, good. A fitting finale!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603274,
    "RowId": 35208,
    "Text": "Commencing basic training regimen. \\\\<crack> Your time to completion will be recorded."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603370,
    "RowId": 35209,
    "Text": "Leave no openings. Your strikes must be quick and decisive."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603442,
    "RowId": 35210,
    "Text": "That concludes your basic training. Commencing \\\\<crick-crack> advanced training regimen."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603542,
    "RowId": 35211,
    "Text": "Remain calm and collected, no matter your circumstances."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603610,
    "RowId": 35212,
    "Text": "Remember─you must hone your skills daily. It will be key to your survival."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603698,
    "RowId": 35213,
    "Text": "\\\\<creak> Regimen complete. Evaluation ranking: 12.\nNot even the lowest order of voidsent would be daunted by such meager strength."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 603842,
    "RowId": 35214,
    "Text": "\\\\<creak> Regimen complete. Evaluation ranking: 9.\nYour mastery of fundamentals will carry you far. Continue your training and seek ever greater heights."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604010,
    "RowId": 35215,
    "Text": "\\\\<creak> Regimen complete. Evaluation ranking: 7.\nA respectable performance. Such strength would prove a match for even warrior-class voidsent."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604166,
    "RowId": 35216,
    "Text": "\\\\<creak> Regimen complete. Evaluation ranking: 5.\nA commendable performance. Such strength would prove a match for even knight-class voidsent."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604322,
    "RowId": 35217,
    "Text": "\\\\<creak> Regimen complete. Evaluation ranking: 3.\nA spectacular performance. Such strength might even prove a match for Galatea herself were she still alive."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604494,
    "RowId": 35218,
    "Text": "\\\\<creak> Regimen complete. Evaluation ranking: 2.\nImpossible... Only Rullus has achieved such a feat."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604610,
    "RowId": 35219,
    "Text": "\\\\<creak> Regimen complete. Evaluation ranking: 1.\nEven the great rulers of voidsent would struggle to contend with such strength."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604754,
    "RowId": 35220,
    "Text": "\\\\<creak> Regimen complete.\nAn equal to Drusilla. Extraordinary..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604834,
    "RowId": 35221,
    "Text": "Arrive at the Silvan Throne"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604874,
    "RowId": 35222,
    "Text": "Clear the Silvan Throne"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604910,
    "RowId": 35223,
    "Text": "Arrive in the forum messorum"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604950,
    "RowId": 35224,
    "Text": "Clear the forum messorum"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 604986,
    "RowId": 35225,
    "Text": "Arrive in Deepspine"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 605018,
    "RowId": 35226,
    "Text": "Defeat Cagnazzo"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 605046,
    "RowId": 35227,
    "Text": "Careful up there─you're not like to see much through the snow."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 605122,
    "RowId": 35228,
    "Text": "おっと、開けたところに出たなァ。\nくれぐれも落ちなさんなよ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 605226,
    "RowId": 35229,
    "Text": "Hopefully that's the last of those winged bastards...\nI'm afraid this is as far as the mammoth'll go. You'll have to make it the rest of the way on foot."
  },
  {
