  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606210,
    "RowId": 35298,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606222,
    "RowId": 35299,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606234,
    "RowId": 35300,
    "Text": "This is quite a crowd of admirers. Did someone send word we were coming?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606318,
    "RowId": 35301,
    "Text": "Ohoho! Shall we do a little dance?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606366,
    "RowId": 35302,
    "Text": "So many partners to choose from!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606410,
    "RowId": 35303,
    "Text": "Your lackeys were found lacking!\nCome out and face your fate!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606486,
    "RowId": 35304,
    "Text": "Insolent worms!\nThe son will be the first to die..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606554,
    "RowId": 35305,
    "Text": "Mummy!\nEr...Daddy! If you could be so kind!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606614,
    "RowId": 35306,
    "Text": "You survived my missiles!?\nThen enjoy some leftover warmachina!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606694,
    "RowId": 35307,
    "Text": "This seems a sturdier group than the last!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606750,
    "RowId": 35308,
    "Text": "Oho! They may indeed survive a few more taps of the hammer!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606822,
    "RowId": 35309,
    "Text": "My warmachina... If reasonable means fail, then unreasonable measures are called for!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606918,
    "RowId": 35310,
    "Text": "Stand back, Hildibrand.\nLet your old man handle this."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 606986,
    "RowId": 35311,
    "Text": "Very well...\nIt seems I must crush you myself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607046,
    "RowId": 35312,
    "Text": "Ohohoho!\nFinally decided to take us seriously, have you?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607118,
    "RowId": 35313,
    "Text": "Prepare to pay for your crimes, Doctor!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607170,
    "RowId": 35314,
    "Text": "Hah hah hah!\nI've had worse chigoe bites!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607226,
    "RowId": 35315,
    "Text": "Ah! I do enjoy some light exercise!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607274,
    "RowId": 35316,
    "Text": "What...what manner of fiend are you!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607322,
    "RowId": 35317,
    "Text": "No mortal man could avoid such a barrage..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607378,
    "RowId": 35318,
    "Text": "Strange. I swear I felt a snowflake fall on me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607438,
    "RowId": 35319,
    "Text": "Hah hah hah!\nHildibrand's mother hits harder than that!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607510,
    "RowId": 35320,
    "Text": "I...must have miscalculated the trajectory."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607566,
    "RowId": 35321,
    "Text": "The hardiness of these Mandervilles, it's...\nIt's unnatural!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607642,
    "RowId": 35322,
    "Text": "Is the case...inspecting mangentle?\nI feel...woozy..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607710,
    "RowId": 35323,
    "Text": "My thanks, Father...\nThat could have been worse."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607774,
    "RowId": 35324,
    "Text": "Impossible!\nThe son is as unbreakable as the father!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607842,
    "RowId": 35325,
    "Text": "Ah, a mild zap to improve the circulation!\nInvigorating!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607914,
    "RowId": 35326,
    "Text": "That was exciting!\nMayhap I should have let it hit me."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 607982,
    "RowId": 35327,
    "Text": "How!? That much power should have rattled the teeth from his skull!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608062,
    "RowId": 35328,
    "Text": "Are we playing a game here!?\nIs he <i>enjoying</i> this!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608138,
    "RowId": 35329,
    "Text": "You aggravating vermin!\nMy plans are in ruins!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608198,
    "RowId": 35330,
    "Text": "The doctor leaves himself wide open!\nLet us seize the advantage!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608278,
    "RowId": 35331,
    "Text": "This move was meant for another, but you've earned my ire!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608350,
    "RowId": 35332,
    "Text": "I have more surprises!\nThis one may shock you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608410,
    "RowId": 35333,
    "Text": "Defeat the hired thugs!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608446,
    "RowId": 35334,
    "Text": "Destroy the missiles!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608478,
    "RowId": 35335,
    "Text": "Defeat the warmachina!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608514,
    "RowId": 35336,
    "Text": "Neutralize the missiles!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608550,
    "RowId": 35337,
    "Text": "Defeat Suprae-Lugae!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608582,
    "RowId": 35338,
    "Text": "Execute limit break!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608614,
    "RowId": 35339,
    "Text": "An amusing diversion, but you'll need to do better than that."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608686,
    "RowId": 35340,
    "Text": "You stopped them all?\nBy <i>sidestepping</i>!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608750,
    "RowId": 35341,
    "Text": "You've forced my hand...\nI'll bring this place down on your heads!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 608830,
    "RowId": 35342,
    "Text": "Gyaaah! Why are they hitting <i>me</i>!?"
  },
  {
